<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-BOAVISTA WIN PORTUGUESE CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOAVISTA WIN PORTUGUESE CUP.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Portuguese Cup</p>
<p>final on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Boavista 3 Benfica 2 (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Boavista - Edwin Sanchez 7, 58-pen, Nuno Gomes 28</p>
<p>Benfica - Jose Calado 34, Paulo Sousa 59-own goal</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
</text>
